<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Feb real agriculture sales down 4.1pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Czech Feb real agriculture sales down 4.1pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech real agricultural sales in February contracted 4.1 percent, year-on-year, the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The CSU added that the average monthly wage in the sector was 7.6 percent higher in February than in the same month of the previous year.</p>
<p>The CSU said the number of people employed by the agriculture sector fell by 5.6 percent, year-on-year, in February.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
